We start by aligning like terms and perform the subtraction:
\begin{align*}
&(2x^6 + 3x^5 + 4x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 20) - (x^6 + 4x^5 + 2x^4 - x^3 + 2x^2 + x + 5)\\
&= (2x^6 - x^6) + (3x^5 - 4x^5) + (4x^4 - 2x^4) + (x^3 + x^3) + (x^2 - 2x^2) + (x - x) + (20 - 5) \\
&= x^6 - x^5 + 2x^4 + 2x^3 - x^2 + 15.
\end{align*}
The final simplified polynomial is:
\[
\boxed{x^6 - x^5 + 2x^4 + 2x^3 - x^2 + 15}
\]

